kunsten_be_flanders_ca6c04cf8273,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/theaterfestival-quartieri-di-vita-napels-zoekt-een-maker-regisseur/,,"Festival Quartieri Di Vita, Flanders Arts Institute, Flemish Diplomatic Representation in Rome",en,‘Quartieri di Vita’ theatre festival (Naples) is looking for a creator/director,"You are active in, and connected to, the Flemish art scene; you have a socially engaged art practice and demonstrable experience of participatory work: working with vulnerable groups. You must be available for the entire period, from 19 to 29 November, on site (departure no later than 18 November and return no earlier than 30 November 2026). It is not essential to speak or understand Italian, but it is an advantage. You are affiliated with an arts organisation in Flanders that works in the field of participation, or you invite an arts organisation in Flanders to follow the process remotely, which has an interest in building relationships with socially engaged practices in the Naples region and in following up on the project after the workshop.",‘Quartieri di Vita’ theatre festival (Naples) is looking for a creator/director,"You are active in, and connected to, the Flemish art scene; you have a socially engaged art practice and demonstrable experience of participatory work: working with vulnerable groups. You must be available for the entire period, from 19 to 29 November, on site (departure no later than 18 November and return no earlier than 30 November 2026). It is not essential to speak or understand Italian, but it is an advantage. You are affiliated with an arts organisation in Flanders that works in the field of participation, or you invite an arts organisation in Flanders to follow the process remotely, which has an interest in building relationships with socially engaged practices in the Naples region and in following up on the project after the workshop.",Friday 2 October at 23:59,2026-10-02,2026-09-23 07:58:03.798548+00:00
