kunsten_be_flanders_37e99c0f0eeb,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/oproep-mapping-atelierwerkingen/,https://form.jotform.com/262223237494053,UFO,en,Call – mapping studio organisations in Belgium,"Are you part of a studio organisation? For an upcoming publication, UFO is currently collecting data to map existing studio collectives in Belgium , including both organisations and smaller initiatives. This publication will include a comprehensive index of studio initiatives in Belgium as of 2026. To be included, please complete the form below by 20 September 2026 at the latest.",Call – mapping studio organisations in Belgium,"Are you part of a studio organisation? For an upcoming publication, UFO is currently collecting data to map existing studio collectives in Belgium , including both organisations and smaller initiatives. This publication will include a comprehensive index of studio initiatives in Belgium as of 2026. To be included, please complete the form below by 20 September 2026 at the latest.",20 Sep 2026,2026-09-20,2026-09-23 07:58:03.807847+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_3511fb00ced1,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-voor-collectieven/,https://form.jotform.com/261593458605364,wpZimmer,en,Open call voor collectieven,"You are an already existing, new or temporary collective of artists/artworkers based in Belgium with the desire to further develop your collective practice. Your collective consists of min. 3 artists or art workers. You are looking for a space to experiment with collectivity and collective practices; You have a process-oriented approach; in other words, you are not focused on a single project, but rather an emerging practice and/or methodology; Your practice does not rely on one discipline or medium; it moves freely between contexts/themes; Your practice aims to bring people together in non-traditional or innovative ways; it is not based on the classic black box setting or white cube approach. You are interested in nurturing a reciprocal relationship with wpZimmer.",Open call voor collectieven,"You are an already existing, new or temporary collective of artists/artworkers based in Belgium with the desire to further develop your collective practice. Your collective consists of min. 3 artists or art workers. You are looking for a space to experiment with collectivity and collective practices; You have a process-oriented approach; in other words, you are not focused on a single project, but rather an emerging practice and/or methodology; Your practice does not rely on one discipline or medium; it moves freely between contexts/themes; Your practice aims to bring people together in non-traditional or innovative ways; it is not based on the classic black box setting or white cube approach. You are interested in nurturing a reciprocal relationship with wpZimmer.",20 Sep 2026,2026-09-20,2026-09-23 07:58:03.812160+00:00
