kunsten_be_flanders_696dbc1b4c63,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-temporary-centre-for-shared-practice/,,Kunsthal Gent,en,Open Call: Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or younger . You hold a degree in higher arts education (visual arts) . Anyone graduating by September 2026 is welcome to apply. You have a connection to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gallerist here, or recently graduated from a Ghent art academy. You recognize the value of a supportive art field and the power of collaboration.",Open Call: Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or younger . You hold a degree in higher arts education (visual arts) . Anyone graduating by September 2026 is welcome to apply. You have a connection to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gallerist here, or recently graduated from a Ghent art academy. You recognize the value of a supportive art field and the power of collaboration.","Sunday, July 5, 2026, 23:59",2026-07-05,2026-09-23 07:58:03.898355+00:00
