kunsten_be_flanders_dc652541cc80,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kunstenpunt-zoekt-beelden-uit-het-kunstenveld/,,Flanders Arts Institute,en,Flanders Arts Institute is looking for images of the arts sector,"Anyone who feels called upon to contribute to representative visual communication is welcome to take part: from amateur photographers to professionals or arts organisations. We ask that you submit a maximum of three images related to one of our disciplines: Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts The images may include both artistic works and performances, as well as behind the scenes images.",Flanders Arts Institute is looking for images of the arts sector,"Anyone who feels called upon to contribute to representative visual communication is welcome to take part: from amateur photographers to professionals or arts organisations. We ask that you submit a maximum of three images related to one of our disciplines: Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts The images may include both artistic works and performances, as well as behind the scenes images.",30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 07:58:03.918618+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_a8b33f98769e,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/contrapuncta-composition-contest-2026-edition/,https://www.helloasso.com/associations/association-contrapuncta/evenements/concours-de-composition,Association Contrapuncta,en,Contrapuncta composition contest – 2026 Edition,"The contest is open to all persons, without restriction of nationality or age. The musical scores are anonymous so that only the works are judged. It is possible to present several works. The proposed work must be original, written for solo piano (2 hands), with a duration between 6 minutes and 12 minutes and not have been commercially exploited.",Contrapuncta composition contest – 2026 Edition,"The contest is open to all persons, without restriction of nationality or age. The musical scores are anonymous so that only the works are judged. It is possible to present several works. The proposed work must be original, written for solo piano (2 hands), with a duration between 6 minutes and 12 minutes and not have been commercially exploited.",30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 07:58:03.921489+00:00
