kunsten_be_flanders_0cd1c7686df6,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/masterclass-fotografie/,https://mentormentor.be/masterclass/,Kunsten,en,Masterclass photography,"Explore different narratives, perspectives and possibilities to tell your personal story in a way that it also appeals to others. In this masterclass you will be challenged to look at your work from a broad perspective and experiment with your archive or unfinished series.",Masterclass photography,"Explore different narratives, perspectives and possibilities to tell your personal story in a way that it also appeals to others. In this masterclass you will be challenged to look at your work from a broad perspective and experiment with your archive or unfinished series.",20 Jun 2026,2026-06-20,2026-09-23 07:58:03.940935+00:00
