kunsten_be_flanders_edb8c38ba1df,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/visio-european-programme-on-artists-moving-images/,https://www.schermodellarte.org/en/visio-2026/,Lo schermo dell’arte,en,VISIO – European Programme on Artists’ Moving Images,"a research, residency, and production programme dedicated to young, Europe-based artists who use moving images in their artistic practice. The 8 participants will be young European-based artists who work with moving images; they will be selected through an open call promoted in collaboration with some of Europe’s leading art academies and artist residencies.",VISIO – European Programme on Artists’ Moving Images,"a research, residency, and production programme dedicated to young, Europe-based artists who use moving images in their artistic practice. The 8 participants will be young European-based artists who work with moving images; they will be selected through an open call promoted in collaboration with some of Europe’s leading art academies and artist residencies.","Friday, May 15th, 2026",2026-05-15,2026-09-23 07:58:03.998991+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_2a9138c53cf6,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/nair-urban-space-installation-residency/,https://www.nart.ee/en/open-call-nair-2026/,Narva Art Residency (NART),en,NAIR urban space installation residency,"We are inviting artists, architects, designers, and other creative practitioners from Estonia and abroad, working in both individual and collaborative practices across visual, spatial, and interdisciplinary fields, to apply. The installation is expected to explore the use of light in its various forms, including reflections of daylight, nighttime lighting solutions, and the presentation of light itself through color. Applicants are required to submit a project proposal for a spatial installation or sculpture.",NAIR urban space installation residency,"We are inviting artists, architects, designers, and other creative practitioners from Estonia and abroad, working in both individual and collaborative practices across visual, spatial, and interdisciplinary fields, to apply. The installation is expected to explore the use of light in its various forms, including reflections of daylight, nighttime lighting solutions, and the presentation of light itself through color. Applicants are required to submit a project proposal for a spatial installation or sculpture.",15.05.2026 at 23:59 (Estonian time),2026-09-23,2026-09-23 07:58:04.002216+00:00
