kunsten_be_flanders_a851810c4e3c,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-hotel-carrousel/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfrOFvLHrIWDp9VWKvSAG0LxmQb5sEQPvi44Xm-E5v8jqgelg/viewform?pli=1,Hotel Carrousel,en,Open Call – Hotel Carrousel,"Artists, duos and collectives under 35 years old and based in Belgium can apply. Our aim is to highlight video and media art as flexible and expansive mediums. Submissions can thus include film, video or audio installation, interactive media works, animation, video performance, or any hybrid practice that exists on the intersection of video or media art with other artistic disciplines. On the final day of the exhibition, we want to host a public programme. If your work includes a live component — such as music, performance, or another form of ‘activation’ — feel free to share this in your application. We welcome existing artworks and adaptations, as long as the work can be completed by mid-May 2026. Artists may submit multiple works, but each must be in a separate application form.",Open Call – Hotel Carrousel,"Artists, duos and collectives under 35 years old and based in Belgium can apply. Our aim is to highlight video and media art as flexible and expansive mediums. Submissions can thus include film, video or audio installation, interactive media works, animation, video performance, or any hybrid practice that exists on the intersection of video or media art with other artistic disciplines. On the final day of the exhibition, we want to host a public programme. If your work includes a live component — such as music, performance, or another form of ‘activation’ — feel free to share this in your application. We welcome existing artworks and adaptations, as long as the work can be completed by mid-May 2026. Artists may submit multiple works, but each must be in a separate application form.","March 29, 2026 23:59",2026-03-29,2026-09-23 07:58:04.125538+00:00
