kunststiftung_nrw_9fcfea3c0364,kunststiftung_nrw,https://www.kunststiftungnrw.de/visuelle-kunst/stiftungsinitiativen/residence-nrw/,https://www.residencenrw.de/de/ausschreibung/,Kunststiftung NRW,de,Residence NRW+,"Die Ausschreibung ist nicht alterslimitiert. Sie richtet sich an professionelle Kunstschaffende mit Lebensmittelpunkt in Nordrhein-Westfalen, die bereits öffentliche Anerkennung erfahren haben und erste Berufserfolge vorweisen können.",Residence NRW+,The call is not age-limited. It is aimed at professional artists with their main place of residence in North Rhine-Westphalia who have already received public recognition and can demonstrate initial professional success.,,,2026-09-23 07:58:12.520942+00:00
kunststiftung_nrw_72dbd2a3195b,kunststiftung_nrw,https://www.residencenrw.de/de/ausschreibung/,,Residence NRW⁺,de,Residence NRW⁺ Ausschreibung,"Residence NRW⁺ richtet sich an bildende Künstler:innen und
                Kurator:innen mit Bezug zum Bundesland Nordrhein-Westfalen
                sowie an Kurator:innen aus der Schweiz.

Residence NRW⁺ richtet sich an Künstler:innen mit Bezug zum
                Bundeland Nordrhein-Westfalen (Herkunft, Studium oder
                Wohn-/Arbeitsort). Erforderlich ist ein abgeschlossenes Studium
                an einer Kunstakademie/Kunsthochschule. Der Abschluss der
                künstlerischen Ausbildung der Stipendiat:innen darf bei Antritt
                des Stipendiums nicht länger als fünf Jahre zurückliegen oder
                die Stipendiat:innen dürfen nicht älter als 40 Jahre sein. Die
                Stipendienzeit vornehmlich am Residenzort zu verbringen und an
                gemeinsamen Veranstaltungen (Arbeitstreffen, Exkursionen,
                Eröffnungen, etc.) teilzunehmen, sind verpflichtend.

Residence NRW⁺ richtet sich an Kurator:innen mit Bezug zum
                Bundesland Nordrhein-Westfalen bzw. der Schweiz, die profunde
                Kenntnisse im Bereich der zeitgenössischen Kunst besitzen und
                bereits eine eigene Vorstellung der kuratorischen Arbeit
                entwickelt haben sowie Gelegenheit hatten, erste Projekte zu
                realisieren. Voraussetzung ist die Bereitschaft, die
                Stipendienzeit vornehmlich am Residenzort zu verbringen und an
                gemeinsamen Veranstaltungen (Arbeitstreffen, Exkursionen,
                Eröffnungen etc.) teilzunehmen. Bewerber:innen mit Bezug zum
                Bundesland NRW müssen ein Universitätsstudium (Master, Diplom,
                Magister oder Promotion; Kunstgeschichte, Kunst,
                Kulturwissenschaften oder ähnliches) abgeschlossen haben;
                ferner gilt, dass ihr Studienabschluss bei Antritt des
                Stipendiums nicht länger als fünf Jahre zurückliegt oder sie
                nicht älter als 35 Jahre sein dürfen. Für Bewerber:innen mit
                Bezug zur Schweiz gilt kein Alterslimit, jedoch darf auch hier
                der Abschluss der Ausbildung oder, falls keine Ausbildung
                vorliegt, die erste öffentliche Präsentation der kuratorischen
                Arbeit nicht länger als 5 Jahre zurückliegen.",Residence NRW⁺ Open Call,"Residence NRW⁺ is aimed at visual artists and curators with a connection to the federal state of North Rhine-Westphalia as well as at curators from Switzerland.

Residence NRW⁺ is aimed at artists with a connection to the federal state of North Rhine-Westphalia (origin, studies, or place of residence/work). A completed degree from an academy of fine arts/art college is required. The completion of the artistic training of the grantees must not be more than five years in the past at the time the stipend begins, or the grantees must not be older than 40 years of age. Spending the stipend period mainly at the residency location and participating in joint events (work meetings, excursions, openings, etc.) are mandatory.

Residence NRW⁺ is aimed at curators with a connection to the federal state of North Rhine-Westphalia or Switzerland who have profound knowledge in the field of contemporary art and who have already developed their own concept of curatorial work as well as had the opportunity to realize initial projects. A prerequisite is the willingness to spend the stipend period mainly at the residency location and to participate in joint events (work meetings, excursions, openings, etc.). Applicants with a connection to the federal state of NRW must have completed a university degree (Master’s, Diploma, Magister, or doctorate; art history, art, cultural studies, or similar); furthermore, their degree must not be more than five years old at the time the stipend begins, or they must not be older than 35 years of age. For applicants with a connection to Switzerland, there is no age limit; however, here too the completion of training, or, if there is no training, the first public presentation of the curatorial work must not be more than 5 years in the past.",,,2026-09-23 07:58:14.989093+00:00
matadero_madrid_15564c0bdd34,matadero_madrid,https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/calls/open-call-situated-research-residencies-2027,https://eu.jotform.com/241562142081346,Matadero Madrid / Medialab Matadero,en,Open Call for Situated Research Residencies 2027,"For individuals or collectives researching in the fields of design, art, architecture, urbanism, economics, film, photography, journalism, digital media, environmental science, philosophy, engineering, social studies, political science, programming, materials science, activism, or any other field consistent with the stated goals. We will value each applicant's particular trajectory, with the aim of fostering exchange between expert and emerging profiles.",Open Call for Situated Research Residencies 2027,"For individuals or collectives researching in the fields of design, art, architecture, urbanism, economics, film, photography, journalism, digital media, environmental science, philosophy, engineering, social studies, political science, programming, materials science, activism, or any other field consistent with the stated goals. We will value each applicant's particular trajectory, with the aim of fostering exchange between expert and emerging profiles.","September 27, 2026, 11:59PM",2026-09-27,2026-09-23 07:58:14.996106+00:00
matadero_madrid_9e814c5cf987,matadero_madrid,https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/calls/open-call-lab-5-mechanics-truth,https://form.jotform.com/251244533209350,Matadero Madrid / Medialab Matadero,en,Open Call - LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth,"The LPC is open to people with experience or training in visual cultures, technologies and digital media, architecture and urbanism, writing, journalism, social studies, activism, science, engineering, economics, and any other field that can connect with one or more of the themes of LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth. Applicants must be 18 years or older. Other than that, we welcome anyone to apply, regardless of origin or place of residence.

This call is aimed both at people who want to propose one of the five projects to be developed and at those who want to join as collaborators in developing them.

In this call we are looking for 5 project leads (“promoters”) and up to 20 collaborators.",Open Call - LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth,"The LPC is open to people with experience or training in visual cultures, technologies and digital media, architecture and urbanism, writing, journalism, social studies, activism, science, engineering, economics, and any other field that can connect with one or more of the themes of LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth. Applicants must be 18 years or older. Other than that, we welcome anyone to apply, regardless of origin or place of residence.

This call is aimed both at people who want to propose one of the five projects to be developed and at those who want to join as collaborators in developing them.

In this call we are looking for 5 project leads (“promoters”) and up to 20 collaborators.","June 14, 2026",2026-06-14,2026-09-23 07:58:15.000088+00:00
