kunsten_be_flanders_8e81a92d284b,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kunstenaar-gezocht-voor-participatief-project-in-sint-agatha-berchem/,https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=5VYrkWCavke4UrG501iDNIKO_mxb6O5Mq8Tb_x8Xku5UNkpWMUhFQkUyM1lWN05VT1pBWDFJQk9PVC4u,"Gemeenschapscentrum De Kroon, Archipel19",en,Artist sought for Participatory Project in Sint-Agatha-Berchem,"We are looking for an artist interested in co-creation, who wants to develop an artistic programme that creates connection in the public space, together with local residents. Are you someone who knows how to harness the power of imagery and nonverbal communication to bring people closer together? Would you like to work with an intergenerational group of residents around Parc Pirsoul? Then this project is for you.",Artist sought for Participatory Project in Sint-Agatha-Berchem,"We are looking for an artist interested in co-creation, who wants to develop an artistic programme that creates connection in the public space, together with local residents. Are you someone who knows how to harness the power of imagery and nonverbal communication to bring people closer together? Would you like to work with an intergenerational group of residents around Parc Pirsoul? Then this project is for you.",18 Dec 2025,2025-12-18,2026-09-23 11:35:02.515109+00:00
