kunsten_be_flanders_99898f67581c,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/ga-op-residentie-bij-ohme-democracy-under-pressure-challenges-and-innovations/,https://ohme.be/projects/open-call-democracy-lab-flanders/,Ohme,en,Open call for artists on the topic Democracy Under Pressure: Challenges and Innovations,"This call is for cross-sectoral artists connected to the contemporary art field of Flanders — that is, artists who live, work, or have a professional practice within the Dutch-speaking art community of Belgium. We are open to all media within the cross-sectoral arts. Cross-sectoral arts start from a distinct artistic discipline, but involve intensive collaboration with social domains outside the arts sector (such as science, healthcare or education).",Open call for artists on the topic Democracy Under Pressure: Challenges and Innovations,"This call is for cross-sectoral artists connected to the contemporary art field of Flanders — that is, artists who live, work, or have a professional practice within the Dutch-speaking art community of Belgium. We are open to all media within the cross-sectoral arts. Cross-sectoral arts start from a distinct artistic discipline, but involve intensive collaboration with social domains outside the arts sector (such as science, healthcare or education).",30 Nov 2025,2025-11-30,2026-09-23 11:35:02.538573+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_77942e92b1c5,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-love-among-the-artists-residency-in-marseille/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeU7SWy-9a8OYt9xQvNHk0NnLMkFAy9MZTdsSLQ-3Nf1Oqfww/viewform,Studio Prouvost,en,Open Call – “Love Among The Artists” Residency in Marseille,"We are interested in artists that explore transitions from urban to natural, from concrete to cliffside, from the city’s buzz to the sea’s calm",Open Call – “Love Among The Artists” Residency in Marseille,"We are interested in artists that explore transitions from urban to natural, from concrete to cliffside, from the city’s buzz to the sea’s calm","Sunday, 30 November 2025 (midnight).",2025-11-30,2026-09-23 11:35:02.544460+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_e8e9e5b5cea5,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/video-art-miden-international-open-call-for-entries-2025-26/,http://www.festivalmiden.gr,Video Art Miden,en,VIDEO ART MIDEN // INTERNATIONAL OPEN CALL FOR ENTRIES 2025-26,"The call is open to every creator (individuals, groups or organizations) of any nationality and background. There are no thematic or morphological restrictions but note that the curatorial focus of Video Art Miden is experimental art videos and not narrative short films. Videos under 6min duration will be preferred. Along with the general open call, Miden addresses a special call for a series of thematic tributes, inviting artists to contribute their personal view and conceptual approach on the following themes: A tablespoon of. Your plate: a knot where flavours and stories on matter, capital, (invisible) labour, coloniality, memory, resistance and care tangle together like spaghetti. Hide and seek Plastic flesh Videodance και video-performance Artificial Intelligence (AI)",VIDEO ART MIDEN // INTERNATIONAL OPEN CALL FOR ENTRIES 2025-26,"The call is open to every creator (individuals, groups or organizations) of any nationality and background. There are no thematic or morphological restrictions but note that the curatorial focus of Video Art Miden is experimental art videos and not narrative short films. Videos under 6min duration will be preferred. Along with the general open call, Miden addresses a special call for a series of thematic tributes, inviting artists to contribute their personal view and conceptual approach on the following themes: A tablespoon of. Your plate: a knot where flavours and stories on matter, capital, (invisible) labour, coloniality, memory, resistance and care tangle together like spaghetti. Hide and seek Plastic flesh Videodance και video-performance Artificial Intelligence (AI)",30 Nov 2025,2025-11-30,2026-09-23 11:35:02.547750+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_3a162d088902,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/way-beyond-residency-program-in-finland-2026/,https://www.arteles.org,Arteles Creative Center,en,Way Beyond – residency program in Finland 2026,"Curious about the cosmos, consciousness, the nature of the mind, and the unknown? Drawn to exploring deeper dimensions — whether metaphysical, psychological, mystical, or quantum molecular? Way Beyond is a transdisciplinary program that brings together open-minded, curiosity-driven individuals interested in expanding our understanding of reality, perception, and how we experience it.",Way Beyond – residency program in Finland 2026,"Curious about the cosmos, consciousness, the nature of the mind, and the unknown? Drawn to exploring deeper dimensions — whether metaphysical, psychological, mystical, or quantum molecular? Way Beyond is a transdisciplinary program that brings together open-minded, curiosity-driven individuals interested in expanding our understanding of reality, perception, and how we experience it.",27 Nov 2025,2025-11-27,2026-09-23 11:35:02.551933+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_6aad32a7d163,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/werkgroep-advies-module-startende-kunstenaars/,,Kunstenpunt,en,Working group advice: module for starting artists,"Are you (or were you) a starting artist and would you like to contribute your thoughts on what advice you could have used (at the time)? Do you experience (high) barriers to getting started as a beginning artist and would you like to help us assess whether we are paying sufficient attention to this? Or do you support starting artists and would you like to contribute your expertise? Then this call is for you. You are active in the visual arts, performing arts, and/or classical music. You are not (or no longer) studying. Or you did not follow the traditional path of art education as an artist. You are at the start of your professional career – regardless of age – or you still have vivid memories of what it was like to be a starting artist. Or you have experience in supporting or guiding artists who are at the start of their professional careers. Or you are experiencing social barriers to starting your career. Due to their underrepresentation in the arts, we want to encourage everyone of color, women, people with disabilities or neurodivergence, members of the LGBTQIA+ community, and individuals who experience financial barriers to participate.",Working group advice: module for starting artists,"Are you (or were you) a starting artist and would you like to contribute your thoughts on what advice you could have used (at the time)? Do you experience (high) barriers to getting started as a beginning artist and would you like to help us assess whether we are paying sufficient attention to this? Or do you support starting artists and would you like to contribute your expertise? Then this call is for you. You are active in the visual arts, performing arts, and/or classical music. You are not (or no longer) studying. Or you did not follow the traditional path of art education as an artist. You are at the start of your professional career – regardless of age – or you still have vivid memories of what it was like to be a starting artist. Or you have experience in supporting or guiding artists who are at the start of their professional careers. Or you are experiencing social barriers to starting your career. Due to their underrepresentation in the arts, we want to encourage everyone of color, women, people with disabilities or neurodivergence, members of the LGBTQIA+ community, and individuals who experience financial barriers to participate.",14 Nov 2025,2025-11-14,2026-09-23 11:35:02.554966+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_270b9d7c803d,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-visual-distruption-day-2025/,https://visualdisruptionday.com/visual-disruption-image-2025,Visually Speaking Agency,en,Open call: Visual Disruption Day 2025,"The Visual Disruption Image 2025 is a competition for creators, artists, designers, activists and creative thinkers. Submitted visuals should be visually striking, carry a clear message and spark thought, discussion or change.",Open call: Visual Disruption Day 2025,"The Visual Disruption Image 2025 is a competition for creators, artists, designers, activists and creative thinkers. Submitted visuals should be visually striking, carry a clear message and spark thought, discussion or change.",01 Nov 2025,2025-11-01,2026-09-23 11:35:02.558970+00:00
