kunsten_be_flanders_c38ccf84a460,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-cinema-canape/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeLTGOleELcKlPxI-kfUjgBmHpKCFaJ5kUl_wfanYvPmVnZag/viewform,Call Canapé vzw,en,Open call Cinema Canapé,"CINEMA CANAPÉ is always looking for people who want to share their work! This call is especially for all filmmakers, video artists, and moving-image makers. This open call will serve as a database. So don’t worry if we don’t reach out to you right away, we’ll keep your submission and contact artists who fit upcoming screenings. Whether you’re working on short film, experimental video, documentary, animation, or something in between: all forms and genres are welcome. No experience needed (but also very welcome) we want to create an open space for experimentation, trying things out, and sharing with others. Our upcoming curation has a special focus on the spooky, mysterious, and dark You can probably guess the occasion… If your work fits this theme, great! and if it doesn’t, still submit it! Who knows, it might be the perfect match for one of our future curations.",Open call Cinema Canapé,"CINEMA CANAPÉ is always looking for people who want to share their work! This call is especially for all filmmakers, video artists, and moving-image makers. This open call will serve as a database. So don’t worry if we don’t reach out to you right away, we’ll keep your submission and contact artists who fit upcoming screenings. Whether you’re working on short film, experimental video, documentary, animation, or something in between: all forms and genres are welcome. No experience needed (but also very welcome) we want to create an open space for experimentation, trying things out, and sharing with others. Our upcoming curation has a special focus on the spooky, mysterious, and dark You can probably guess the occasion… If your work fits this theme, great! and if it doesn’t, still submit it! Who knows, it might be the perfect match for one of our future curations.",20 Oct 2025,2025-10-20,2026-09-23 11:35:02.574609+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_6f9b625b869d,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/word-een-rema-member/,https://www.rema-eemn.net/join-us/,REMA,en,Become REMA member,"Since 25 May 2023, REMA has been open to all types of early music players (ensembles, festivals, concert halls, research institutes, labels, agents, conservatoires, etc.).

CRITERIA FOR JOINING
Applicant organisations must have been in existence for a minimum of three years and possess a legal entity status.
The Board of Directors will look at:
The overall quality of the activities
The alignment of the applicants’ values with REMA
The criteria and selection process are detailed in the full call.

You will be asked to:
Provide information about your organisation.
Select a main activity: promoter, ensemble, education, research, agent, publisher or other. Once accepted, members can represent all their activities.
Answer specific questions related to your main activity and submit relevant documentation (e.g. programme of activities, list of publications, concerts, etc.)
Explain your motivation for joining REMA and how your values are in line with the network.
Submit a letter of recommendation from a REMA member.

Additional information: if you have taken part in a network project in the past, include this information in your application.

CODE OF CONDUCT
From the moment they apply, all candidates must endorse the network’s code of conduct, established with the members, which ensures adherence to professional ethics among REMA members.",Become REMA member,"Since 25 May 2023, REMA has been open to all types of early music players (ensembles, festivals, concert halls, research institutes, labels, agents, conservatoires, etc.).

CRITERIA FOR JOINING
Applicant organisations must have been in existence for a minimum of three years and possess a legal entity status.
The Board of Directors will look at:
The overall quality of the activities
The alignment of the applicants’ values with REMA
The criteria and selection process are detailed in the full call.

You will be asked to:
Provide information about your organisation.
Select a main activity: promoter, ensemble, education, research, agent, publisher or other. Once accepted, members can represent all their activities.
Answer specific questions related to your main activity and submit relevant documentation (e.g. programme of activities, list of publications, concerts, etc.)
Explain your motivation for joining REMA and how your values are in line with the network.
Submit a letter of recommendation from a REMA member.

Additional information: if you have taken part in a network project in the past, include this information in your application.

CODE OF CONDUCT
From the moment they apply, all candidates must endorse the network’s code of conduct, established with the members, which ensures adherence to professional ethics among REMA members.",08 Oct 2025,2025-10-08,2026-09-23 11:35:02.578298+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_a5a634ac992c,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/gezocht-belgische-fotografen-voor-nieuwe-tentoonstelling-bij-hangar/,https://www.hangar.art/open-call2025,Hangar,en,Open Call: Reinventing Photography by Hangar,"Conditions for participation being over the age of majority (18+) being a Belgian artist photographer and/or artists photographers residing in Belgium should demonstrate at least ONE of these two possibilities: – have a track record of professional practice as an artist (exhibitions, publications) – have an art school degree This call is open ONLY for original and unpublished projects / The works must be conceived, created, and produced specifically for this commission and presented for the first time at Hangar.",Open Call: Reinventing Photography by Hangar,"Conditions for participation being over the age of majority (18+) being a Belgian artist photographer and/or artists photographers residing in Belgium should demonstrate at least ONE of these two possibilities: – have a track record of professional practice as an artist (exhibitions, publications) – have an art school degree This call is open ONLY for original and unpublished projects / The works must be conceived, created, and produced specifically for this commission and presented for the first time at Hangar.",03 Oct 2025,2025-10-03,2026-09-23 11:35:02.581542+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_655be783ebe9,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/belgian-photo-awards-2025/,https://belgianphotoawards.com/,Belgian Photo Awards,en,Belgian Photo Awards 2025,"The Belgian Photo Awards honor professional photography talent in Belgium, with awards in a variety of categories: from portrait and documentary to wedding photography and commercial assignments. In addition to the category winners, three special awards will be presented: Winner of a category (With additional Theme category, celebrations, fête party) Photographer of the Year 2025 Young Talent Award for emerging talent (18-35) A selection for the World Photographic Cup, the Olympics of photographyIn addition to the category winners, three special awards will be presented:",Belgian Photo Awards 2025,"The Belgian Photo Awards honor professional photography talent in Belgium, with awards in a variety of categories: from portrait and documentary to wedding photography and commercial assignments. In addition to the category winners, three special awards will be presented: Winner of a category (With additional Theme category, celebrations, fête party) Photographer of the Year 2025 Young Talent Award for emerging talent (18-35) A selection for the World Photographic Cup, the Olympics of photographyIn addition to the category winners, three special awards will be presented:",10 Sep 2025,2025-09-10,2026-09-23 11:35:02.586750+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_8f8f6267956f,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/stel-je-kandidaat-om-als-regisseur-te-werken-met-kwetsbare-groepen-uit-napels/,,Fondazione Campania dei Festival / EUNIC / Flemish Diplomatic Representation Rome / Flanders Arts Insitute,en,Apply to work as a director for vulnerable groups from the Campania region (Naples),"You are active in and connected to the Flemish art scene, you have a socially engaged art practice and demonstrable experience with participation: working with vulnerable groups. You are available for the entire period, from November 16 to November 30, on site (departure no later than November 15 and return no earlier than December 1, 2025). It is not necessary to speak or understand Italian, but it is a plus. You are affiliated with an art organization in Flanders that works around participation, or you invite an art organization in Flanders that follows the process from a distance, has an interest in relationships with socially engaged practices in the Naples region, and in a follow-up to the project after the workshop.",Apply to work as a director for vulnerable groups from the Campania region (Naples),"You are active in and connected to the Flemish art scene, you have a socially engaged art practice and demonstrable experience with participation: working with vulnerable groups. You are available for the entire period, from November 16 to November 30, on site (departure no later than November 15 and return no earlier than December 1, 2025). It is not necessary to speak or understand Italian, but it is a plus. You are affiliated with an art organization in Flanders that works around participation, or you invite an art organization in Flanders that follows the process from a distance, has an interest in relationships with socially engaged practices in the Naples region, and in a follow-up to the project after the workshop.",05 Sep 2025,2025-09-05,2026-09-23 11:35:02.591630+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_437b564efaf9,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/residentie-bij-khmessen-noorwegen/,http://www.khmessen.no/,Kunstnarhuset Messen,en,Residency at KHMessen (Noorwegen),"We welcome visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists at any stage of their careers who are interested in exploring and expanding their work in a unique and supportive environment.",Residency at KHMessen (Noorwegen),"We welcome visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists at any stage of their careers who are interested in exploring and expanding their work in a unique and supportive environment.",31 Aug 2025,2025-08-31,2026-09-23 11:35:02.595303+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_e7ad5b0af54f,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-voor-residentie-silence-awareness-existence-in-finland/,https://www.arteles.org,Arteles Creative Center,en,Open Call for residency Silence Awareness Existence in Finland,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced. Taking place at the heart of the Northern winter, the conditions are excellent for creative contemplation, solitary introspection, concentrating intensively on your work, thinking and being, as well as for sharing experiences and ideas with other, similarly oriented minds. There is no pressure to have a concrete productive outcome, in case your focus is more in inner development, self-reflection and research. All participation in group activities is voluntary. Applicants who otherwise would be unable to join the program can apply for financial support. The number of financially supported residencies is limited.",Open Call for residency Silence Awareness Existence in Finland,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced. Taking place at the heart of the Northern winter, the conditions are excellent for creative contemplation, solitary introspection, concentrating intensively on your work, thinking and being, as well as for sharing experiences and ideas with other, similarly oriented minds. There is no pressure to have a concrete productive outcome, in case your focus is more in inner development, self-reflection and research. All participation in group activities is voluntary. Applicants who otherwise would be unable to join the program can apply for financial support. The number of financially supported residencies is limited.",28 Aug 2025,2025-08-28,2026-09-23 11:35:02.598846+00:00
