kunsten_be_flanders_1699eb1c0875,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/2025-art-explora-academie-des-beaux-arts-european-award/,https://artexplora.awardsplatform.com/,Art Explora – Académie des beaux-arts,en,2025 Art Explora – Académie des beaux-arts European Award,"Open to all European cultural organizations, from all artistic sectors, the European Award supports innovative practices in audience access, participation and engagement that can be shared across Europe.",2025 Art Explora – Académie des beaux-arts European Award,"Open to all European cultural organizations, from all artistic sectors, the European Award supports innovative practices in audience access, participation and engagement that can be shared across Europe.",09 Jul 2025,2025-07-09,2026-09-23 11:35:02.607121+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_9f8455aab22f,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/hyster-x-zoekt-geengageerde-bestuursleden/,,Hyster-x,en,Hyster-x is looking for engaged board members,"Who are we looking for?
We’re looking for people who:
●		resonate with our mission and values;
●		have experience with or affinity for the cultural, literary, or feminist sector;
●		have a heart for word art and social justice;
●		can think critically and want to build constructively together;
●		want to contribute to conversations about inclusion, representation, and collective creation;
●		We are looking for at least one board member with financial insight , to help oversee bookkeeping, funding processes, and the sustainable development of our organization.
Previous experience on a board is welcome, but not required. We aim to assemble a board that is diverse in background, experience, perspective, and expertise.",Hyster-x is looking for engaged board members,"Who are we looking for?
