u_jazdowski_warsaw_12d96c6e05cf,u_jazdowski_warsaw,https://u-jazdowski.pl/en/programme/residencies/open-calls/rezydencje-kryzysowe-pazdziernik,https://u-jazdowski.pl/en/programme/residencies/open-calls/rezydencje-kryzysowe-pazdziernik,"Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art, Zachęta – National Gallery of Art and Centre of Polish Sculpture in Orońsko",en,Emergency residencies for Ukrainian artists,"Artists are invited to apply to 1 of the listed above organizations with a short note including:
— name and surname
— e-mail and phone number
— info if you are coming with a partner / kids / parents
— the statement that you've crossed the Ukrainian border after 24th February 2022, and you are of a Ukrainian nationality (in any form)
— a link to social media or website presenting your artistic practice, or your artistic portfolio
— motivation letter

This open call is dedicated to all Ukrainian artists who crossed the Ukrainian border after February 24, 2022, because of the war.",Emergency residencies for Ukrainian artists,"Artists are invited to apply to 1 of the listed above organizations with a short note including:
